ui-_R_1mshlktbsnlhjiuqsnpfiutb_" aria-label="More actions" class="group disabled:pointer-events-none [&amp;&gt;span]:line-clamp-1 overflow-hidden group focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:focus-visible:outline-primary-light py-0.5 gap-1 text-sm text-gray-950/50 dark:text-white/50 group-hover:text-gray-950/70 dark:group-hover:text-white/70 rounded-none rounded-r-xl border flex items-center justify-center h-[34px] border-gray-200 aspect-square dark:border-white/[0.07] bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark hover:bg-gray-600/5 dark:hover:bg-gray-200/5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="size-3 transition-transform text-gray-400 group-hover:text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-600 dark:group-hover:text-gray-400 shrink-0 rotate-90"><path d="M6.5 2.75L12.75 9L6.5 15.25" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="mt-2 text-lg prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert [&amp;&gt;*]:[overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><p>Learn about Protocol Overview in LayerZero V2. Understand the architecture, core concepts, and how it enables omnichain interoperability. Architecture and im…</p></div><div id="page-context-menu" class="flex items-center shrink-0 min-w-[156px] mt-3 @[520px]/page-header:hidden"><button id="page-context-menu-button" class="rounded-l-xl px-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 py-1.5 border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/[0.07] bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark hover:bg-gray-600/5 dark:hover:bg-gray-200/5 border-r-0" aria-label="Copy page"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-center font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0"><path d="M14.25 5.25H7.25C6.14543 5.25 5.25 6.14543 5.25 7.25V14.25C5.25 15.3546 6.14543 16.25 7.25 16.25H14.25C15.3546 16.25 16.25 15.3546 16.25 14.25V7.25C16.25 6.14543 15.3546 5.25 14.25 5.25Z" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2.80103 11.998L1.77203 5.07397C1.61003 3.98097 2.36403 2.96397 3.45603 2.80197L10.38 1.77297C11.313 1.63397 12.19 2.16297 12.528 3.00097" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="grid"><span aria-hidden="true" class="invisible col-start-1 row-start-1">Copy page</span><span class="col-start-1 row-start-1">Copy page</span></span></div></button><button type="button" tabindex="0" aria-haspopup="menu" id="base-ui-_R_3dhlktbsnlhjiuqsnpfiutb_" aria-label="More actions" class="group disabled:pointer-events-none [&amp;&gt;span]:line-clamp-1 overflow-hidden group focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:focus-visible:outline-primary-light py-0.5 gap-1 text-sm text-gray-950/50 dark:text-white/50 group-hover:text-gray-950/70 dark:group-hover:text-white/70 rounded-none rounded-r-xl border flex items-center justify-center h-[34px] border-gray-200 aspect-square dark:border-white/[0.07] bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark hover:bg-gray-600/5 dark:hover:bg-gray-200/5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="size-3 transition-transform text-gray-400 group-hover:text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-600 dark:group-hover:text-gray-400 shrink-0 rotate-90"><path d="M6.5 2.75L12.75 9L6.5 15.25" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg></button></div></header><div class="mdx-content @container/columns-container relative mt-8 prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert [contain:inline-size] isolate empty:hidden mb-14" data-page-title="Protocol Overview" data-page-href="/v2/concepts/protocol/protocol-overview" id="content"><span data-as="p">To send a crosschain message, a user must write a transaction on both the source and destination blockchains.</span>
<span data-as="p">At its core, the LayerZero protocol defines a <strong>channel</strong> between a <code>sender</code> and a <code>receiver</code> smart contract by leveraging two key components:</span>
<ul>
<li>
<span data-as="p"><strong>Source and Destination Endpoints:</strong><br/>
<!-- -->Each supported blockchain deploys an immutable, permissionless Endpoint contract. On the source chain, a smart contract calls the Endpoint’s entry function (<code>endpoint.send()</code>) to send a message. On the destination chain, a smart contract authorizes the Endpoint to act as an exit point to receive and process that same message (<code>endpoint.lzReceive()</code>).</span>
</li>
<li>
<span data-as="p"><strong>Channel Definition:</strong><br/>
<!-- -->A unique messaging channel in LayerZero is defined by four specific components:</span>
<ol>
<li>
<span data-as="p"><strong>Sender Contract (Source OApp):</strong> The contract initiating the crosschain communication.</span>
</li>
<li>
<span data-as="p"><strong>Source Endpoint ID:</strong> The identifier for the Endpoint on the source chain.</span>
</li>
<li>
<span data-as="p"><strong>Destination Endpoint ID:</strong> The identifier for the Endpoint on the destination chain.</span>
</li>
<li>
<span data-as="p"><strong>Receiver Contract (Destination OApp):</strong> The contract designated to receive and process the message on the destination chain.</span>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ul>
<span data-as="p">Within each channel, message ordering is maintained through nonce tracking. This ensures that messages are delivered exactly once.</span>
<span data-as="p">For example, if a token bridge on one chain sends a message to its counterpart on another chain, the messages flow through a dedicated channel — distinct from all other application pathways between those chains — preserving the integrity and sequence of communication.</span>
<h2 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="how-the-protocol-works"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#how-the-protocol-works" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M8.50001 6.827C8.14801 6.995 7.81801 7.225 7.52701 7.517L7.51701 7.527C6.13601 8.908 6.13601 11.146 7.51701 12.527L9.69201 14.702C11.073 16.083 13.311 16.083 14.692 14.702L14.702 14.692C16.083 13.311 16.083 11.073 14.702 9.692L13.771 8.761" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.50002 11.173C9.85202 11.005 10.182 10.775 10.473 10.483L10.483 10.473C11.864 9.092 11.864 6.854 10.483 5.473L8.30802 3.298C6.92702 1.917 4.68902 1.917 3.30802 3.298L3.29802 3.308C1.91702 4.689 1.91702 6.927 3.29802 8.308L4.22902 9.239" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><span class="cursor-pointer">How the Protocol Works</span></h2>
<span data-ramka-trigger="" class="zoom-image-trigger contents cursor-zoom-in"><span class="contents"><picture class="contents"><img data-path="images/learn/protocolv2light.svg" src="https://mintcdn.com/layerzero/VohHXGobQ14zkw24/images/learn/protocolv2light.svg?fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=VohHXGobQ14zkw24&amp;q=85&amp;s=1e6425cec656ea5235837f655e5dcd9d" alt="Diagram showing LayerZero V2 protocol flow: message dispatch through source Endpoint, Message Library generating standardized packets, DVN verification, and execution via lzReceive on the destination chain" class="object-contain block dark:hidden" width="1920" height="1044" decoding="async" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" srcSet="https://mintcdn.com/layerzero/VohHXGobQ14zkw24/images/learn/protocolv2light.svg?w=280&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=VohHXGobQ14zkw24&amp;q=85&amp;s=0ea30c9dcac7b1efe07f98005a64ec80 280w, https://mintcdn.com/layerzero/VohHXGobQ14zkw24/images/learn/protocolv2light.svg?w=560&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=VohHXGobQ14zkw24&amp;q=85&amp;s=d53ab0a7559b0319cbad2da676b35c96 560w, https://mintcdn.com/layerzero/VohHXGobQ14zkw24/images/learn/protocolv2light.svg?w=840&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=VohHXGobQ14zkw24&amp;q=85&amp;s=16b5e6c6cd7171d61ff654e1f34d7aed 840w, https://mintcdn.com/layerzero/VohHXGobQ14zkw24/images/learn/protocolv2light.svg?w=1100&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=VohHXGobQ14zkw24&amp;q=85&amp;s=f9d6d800fe7157cff947d1b4c29aaa77 1100w, https://mintcdn.com/layerzero/VohHXGobQ14zkw24/images/learn/protocolv2light.svg?w=1650&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=VohHXGobQ14zkw24&amp;q=85&amp;s=03224e129dc40196645eeb940d7094e7 1650w, https://mintcdn.com/layerzero/VohHXGobQ14zkw24/images/learn/protocolv2light.svg?w=2500&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=VohHXGobQ14zkw24&amp;q=85&amp;s=1c9fef36cb0d8bda36da0a9045cce9fd 2500w" data-optimize="true" style="aspect-ratio:1920 / 1044"/></picture></span></span><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="fal