 Glossary\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Glossary\",\"description\":\"Learn about LayerZero V2 Glossary in LayerZero V2. Understand the architecture, core concepts, and how it enables omnichain interoperability. Essential infor...\",\"keywords\":[\"LayerZero\",\"concepts\"],\"lastUpdated\":\"2025-01-13\",\"author\":\"LayerZero\",\"schema\":\"Article\",\"related\":[\"/v2/concepts/application-design-patterns\",\"/v2/concepts/applications/lzasset\",\"/v2/concepts/applications/composer-standard\"],\"toc_min_heading\":\"2\",\"toc_max_heading\":\"5\",\"href\":\"/v2/concepts/glossary\"},{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"General FAQ\",\"description\":\"Frequently asked questions about LayerZero V2 protocol. Find answers to common development and integration questions. Crosschain development with LayerZero V2.\",\"keywords\":[\"LayerZero\",\"FAQ\",\"questions\",\"help\",\"support\"],\"lastUpdated\":\"2025-01-13\",\"author\":\"LayerZero\",\"schema\":\"FAQPage\",\"related\":[\"/v1/deployments/deployed-contracts\",\"/v2/AGENTS\"],\"id\":\"faq\",\"href\":\"/v2/faq\"}]},{\"group\":\"Crosschain Development\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Crosschain Development\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Introduction\",\"description\":\"Build omnichain applications with LayerZero. Transfer tokens, compose crosschain operations, and send arbitrary messages across 150+ blockchains.\",\"keywords\":[\"LayerZero\",\"crosschain\",\"omnichain\",\"interoperability\",\"OFT\",\"OApp\",\"Stargate\"],\"lastUpdated\":\"2025-01-23\",\"author\":\"LayerZero\",\"schema\":\"Article\",\"href\":\"/crosschain/index\"},{\"title\":\"Issue Crosschain Assets\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Issue Assets\",\"description\":\"Create and deploy Omnichain Fungible Tokens (OFTs) that work natively across 150+ blockchains without bridges or wrapped assets.\",\"keywords\":[\"OFT\",\"omnichain\",\"fungible token\",\"crosschain\",\"token bridge\",\"ONFT\"],\"lastUpdated\":\"2025-01-23\",\"author\":\"LayerZero\",\"schema\":\"HowTo\",\